<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/2> skos:definition "Notice that a specific document will be accompanying the goods."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/3> skos:definition "The specified document is conditionally accepted."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/4> skos:definition "Notice that a specific document/message will be transmitted via a separate EDI message."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/5> skos:definition "Notice that the specific document or message is for information only."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/6> skos:definition "Notice that a specific document or message will not be sent via EDI."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/7> skos:definition "Request for a specific message to be formatted and transmitted or a request for a specific document to be raised and sent."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/8> skos:definition "The specified document is rejected."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/9> skos:definition "The document or message is to be printed."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/10> skos:definition "Specific document is currently valid."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/11> skos:definition "Specified document is not available."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/12> skos:definition "Customs declaration to which the document is related completed or exhaust the allowance stated on the document. The document is attached to the Customs declaration."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/13> skos:definition "Customs declaration to which the document is related does not complete or exhaust the allowance stated on the document . The document is not attached to the declaration but has already been lodged in the Customs station."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/14> skos:definition "Customs declaration to which the document is related completed or exhaust the allowance stated on the document. The usage of the document is complete. The document is not attached to the declaration but has already been lodged in the Customs station."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document/status/15> skos:definition "Customs declaration to which the document is related does not complete or exhaust the allowance stated on the document. The document can continue to be used for future declarations until the allowance is exhausted. The document is not attached to the declaration but has already been lodged in the Customs station."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/719> skos:definition "A period of time which includes the century, year, month, day, hour and minute. Format of period to be given in actual message without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/720> skos:definition "Format of period to be given without hyphen (D=day of the week, 1=Monday; 2=Tuesday; ... 7=Sunday)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/801> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of years."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/802> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of months."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/803> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of weeks."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/804> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of days."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/805> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of hours."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/806> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of minutes."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/807> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of seconds."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/808> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of semesters (six months)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/809> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of four months periods."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/810> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of trimesters (three months)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/811> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of half months."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/812> skos:definition "To indicate a quantity of ten days periods."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/813> skos:definition "Numeric representation of the day (Monday = 1)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/814> skos:definition "Number of working days."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/718> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start date followed by the end date (both including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/717> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start date followed by the end date (both not including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/716> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start week of a year followed by the end week of year (both including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/715> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start week of a year followed by the end week of year (both not including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/713> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start time followed by the end time (format year, month, day, hour and minute). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/710> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start month of a year followed by the end month of a year (both including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/709> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start month of a year followed by the end month of a year (both not including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/708> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start quarter of a year followed by the end quarter of year (both including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/707> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start quarter of a year followed by the end quarter of year (both not including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/706> skos:definition "Format of period to be given without hyphen (P = period of 4 months)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/705> skos:definition "Format of period to be given without hyphen (P = period of 4 months)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/704> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start semester of a year followed by the end semester of a year (both including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/703> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start semester of a year followed by the end semester of a year (both not including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/702> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start year followed by the end year (both including century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/701> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start year followed by the end year (both without century). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/616> skos:definition "Week within a calendar year: CC = Century; Y = Year; W = Week (1st week of January = week 01)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/615> skos:definition "Week within a calendar year: Y = Year; W = Week 1st week of January = week 01."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/614> skos:definition "To specifiy a ten-day period within a month of a year, including century  (A = ten day period)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/613> skos:definition "To specifiy a ten-day period within a month of a year (A = ten day period)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/610> skos:definition "Month within a calendar year: CC = Century; Y = Year; M = Month."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/609> skos:definition "Month within a calendar year: Y = Year; M = Month."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/608> skos:definition "Quarter in a calendar year: C = Century; Y = Year; Q = Quarter."@en .
