<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/603> skos:definition "Semester in a calendar year: Y = Year; S = Semester."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/602> skos:definition "Calendar year including century: C = Century; Y = Year."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/601> skos:definition "Calendar year: Y = Year."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/600> skos:definition "Century."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/503> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start time followed by the end time (both expressed by hours minutes, seconds and time zone). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/502> skos:definition "A period of time specified by giving the start time followed by the end time (both expressed by hours minutes and seconds). Data is to be transmitted as consecutive characters without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/501> skos:definition "Time span without seconds: H = Hour; m = Minute;."@en .
