<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/308> skos:definition "A period of time which includes the century, year, month, day, hour and minute and time zone. Format of period to be given in actual message without hyphen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/307> skos:definition "Calendar date including time with seconds and milliseconds C = century, Y = year, M = month, D = day, H = hour, M = minute, S = second, F = millisecond."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/306> skos:definition "Day, hours, minutes; D = Day; H = Hour; M = Minute."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/305> skos:definition "Month, day, hours, minutes; M = Month; D = Day; H = Hour; M = Minute."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/304> skos:definition "See 204 plus Z=Time zone."@en .
