<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/6> skos:definition "Half-month: CC=century YY=year MM=month, B=1:first half month, B=2:second half month."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/7> skos:definition "Week within a calendar month: CC=century YY=year MM=month. W=1-5 first week to fifth week in a month."@en .
