<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/10> skos:definition "Calendar date including time with minutes: C=Century; Y=Year; M=Month; D=Day; T=Time designator; H=Hour; M=Minutes. The character [T] shall be used as time designator to indicate the start of the representation of the time. For example: 20010912T1433."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/date_time_format/101> skos:definition "Calendar date: Y = Year; M = Month; D = Day."@en .
