<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/165> skos:definition "The object or item needs to be replaced."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/166> skos:definition "The object or item is non sellable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/167> skos:definition "Indicates that the process is in progress."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/168> skos:definition "Indicates that the processing has been halted pending response to a query."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/169> skos:definition "Indicates that the processing reached the final status, full payment has been passed."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/170> skos:definition "Indicates that the processing has been acknowledged as understood."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/171> skos:definition "Indicates that processing has been accepted under conditions stated and proceeded accordingly unless disputed."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/155> skos:definition "The object or item is reserved."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/154> skos:definition "The object or item is recalled."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/153> skos:definition "The object or item is unavailable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/152> skos:definition "The object or item is available."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/151> skos:definition "The object is returned."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/150> skos:definition "The object is registered."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/149> skos:definition "The object is reused."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/148> skos:definition "The object is recycled."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/147> skos:definition "The object does not meet requirements due to defects."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/146> skos:definition "The goods/consignment/transport equipment has been transhipped from one means of transport to another."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/145> skos:definition "A status indicating that there is a security related matter to report for the specified leg in the itinerary."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/144> skos:definition "The ship has taken special or additional security measures, beyond those specified in the approved ship security plan."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/143> skos:definition "A confirmation that ship security procedures in terms of the approved in the Ship Security Plan were maintained during ship-to-ship activity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/142> skos:definition "Ship security procedures, specified in the approved ship security plan, have not been maintained during each of the ship-to-ship activities specified."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/141> skos:definition "Specific protective security measures shall be maintained for a limited period of time when a security incident is probable or imminent, although it may not be possible to identify the specific target."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/140> skos:definition "Appropriate additional protective security measures shall be maintained for a period of time as a result of heightened risk of a security incident."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/status/status/139> skos:definition "Minimum appropriate protective security measures shall be maintained at all times on the means of transport."@en .
